WEBVTT

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.480
Knock it off, you two!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.110
Oh? I'm amazed he was willing 
to let you have Ozasa.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.000
Sosuke!

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.090
Stop it, Sosuke!

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.810
I said to cut the crap!

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:39.250
So you want me to stand 
still and let him kill me?

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.390
That's not what I meant!

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.730
It's just, he's...

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:43.890
I am a shadow.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.650
I am a shadow with your 
memories sealed inside of me.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.800
Together, the two of us create "Sosuke".

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:56.350
If we kill him, who knows 
what'll happen to you?

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.240
It's truly hard to say.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.250
It might be worth putting to the test.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:08.360
Sosuke!

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:46.760
In Homage

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.380
Shino!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.040
I think you're breaking 
the rules with that.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.270
Like I care!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.650
What now?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.400
Are you going to cut me down, Shino?

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.430
If you can't choose one of us,

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:06.410
it's the same as choosing 
neither, Shino!

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.890
I can't choose?

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.620
Don't be such a deadhead!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.470
I've already chosen Sosu-

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:12.370
Then why don't you kill me already?

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.380
If you can't, then that's proof 
that you still haven't chosen!

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:19.880
Shino!

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:33.630
If you can't choose one of us, 
it's the same as choosing neither.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.520
Choose...?

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.170
How could I choose?

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.530
Don't the two of you make one person?

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.940
Aw, screw it!

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.590
None of this makes sense!

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:52.670
Yana is...!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.150
Yana's Seal...?

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:07.650
On our way back from the shrine,

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:11.260
I noticed a sudden gust of wind 
and then a black shadow...!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:15.440
It looked just like the symbol 
on Princess Yana's leg.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.590
This really is the 
regional deity's curse.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.120
Princess Yana said that the 
regional deity is dead.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.180
Then where did the monster that looks

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.450
just like Yana's symbol come from?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.940
I was careless...

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.020
I never expected Yana to show itself in

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.460
response to Murasame's demonic aura.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:43.060
I must have pushed 
Shino a tad too far for

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.470
Murasame to release 
that strong of an aura.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.490
What is this all about?

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:49.400
I've lost interest in our fight.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.470
It looks like Shino has 
sided with you for now.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.480
What exactly are you?

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.480
I am your shadow... for now.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.800
Is this pain coming from Yana's Seal?

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.110
I've... seen it happen.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.240
What have you seen?

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:11.530
A black shadow leave 
Princess Yana's body.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.010
The same day it leaves,

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.120
someone from the village always dies.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.360
I know.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:21.680
The one committing these

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.510
murders is the Yana 
inside of Princess Yana.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.010
But she is unaware of 
what is happening...

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.150
Careful.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.750
Princess Yana?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.990
Excellent timing. Do you have a moment?

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:39.310
Please...

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:40.770
Princess Yana?

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:42.860
I'm begging you!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.340
Please... Please lock me away somewhere!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:50.140
I never noticed what was happening!

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.160
I can't believe Yana is killing people!

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:53.790
It's killing people?

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.790
Just... Just put an end to my life!

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:00.790
Why?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.050
Why is that crying?

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.070
What's crying?

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.990
My other half.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.050
What do you mean?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:14.200
Through human hands, 
We were split in two.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.630
Half was locked within the land...

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.780
...while half was locked within a human

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.500
and sealed inside a shrine.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.570
Thus they prevented Us 
from leaving this region.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:28.180
We were supposed to have rested 
in slumber thenceforth,

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.650
so why is it crying?

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:33.350
Are you talking about Princess Yana?

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.810
She reminds me of how you 
were years ago, Shino.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:40.060
Did you know Shino a long time ago?

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:41.940
Yeah.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:45.960
You see, I've always been with you.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:51.890
Hey, stop right there!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.220
What're you gonna do about him?!

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.240
You may have him, Shino.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.480
Wai-Don't be stupid! Hey!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.870
"Want me to set you free?"

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.480
"What is your wish?"

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.070
That's what the man told you?

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:09.670
Right. The villagers began 
to pass away after that.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:14.250
I'm certain that the Yana 
inside of me was set free...

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:15.990
Please!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.120
Kill me before it has a 
chance to kill someone else.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.310
Yana!

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.120
Princess Yana! Yana!

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:28.160
Brother Takanobu... Saki...

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:32.940
I'm sorry!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.530
I'm sorry! I'm sorry...

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.140
Yana?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:44.070
If I died... If I disappeared 
from your lives, everyone...

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.880
Princess Yana...

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.650
Are you sure?

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.400
With Shino back safe and sound,

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.290
this is wasted on someone like me.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:08:00.010
Gosh darn... I will 
have to mend my jacket.

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:04.860
Sosuke, you're hurt!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.700
That's a serious injury!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.950
Are you okay?

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:16.740
Y-yeah... It isn't as deep as it looks.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.250
It hardly even hurts.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.680
We gotta hurry and stop the bleeding!

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.750
It doesn't "hardly" hurt.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.010
I can't feel any pain at all.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:28.440
And here this is a rather 
serious injury...

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:31.970
Murasame...

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:35.030
In order to obtain 
power equal to that...

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:40.950
...how much more must I steal?

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:42.960
Welcome back, Bro!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.360
Is it true that the man you 
were after kidnapped you?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.270
But I'm already back, aren't I?

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.190
Did he do anything to you?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:54.720
Bro, for some reason, that 
sounds sketchy coming from you.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.720
He didn't do anything!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.370
You've picked up something 
strange again...

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:00.970
Huh?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.730
But that's fine.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:06.260
That aside, Shino, please accompany me

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.110
to the shrine tomorrow morning.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.200
The shrine?

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:12.050
I suspect you're better 
suited for this task than I.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:16.490
Do you think Princess 
Yana will be all right?

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.330
I'm so sorry!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.800
I was the only one who never noticed.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:25.000
I'm sorry!

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.480
I've never seen her like that before.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.140
Is it wise to present Yana as an

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.540
oracle tomorrow when 
she's so distraught...?

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:38.220
Are you saying that as her guardian?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.470
And what about you?

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.770
I've listened to numerous 
people's wishes.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.780
But no matter how many wishes 
I grant, the people still come.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.250
They don't come to see me,

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.460
but the Yana that resides inside of me.

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.860
There is no end to their wishes...

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.790
Even so, Yana never once 
barked a complaint.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.910
I'm willing to grant your wish.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:10.980
He was the first person 
to ever say that to me.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.780
What is your wish?

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:18.360
However, he was not truly asking me...

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.000
Wishes come at a price.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.510
What's with the huge line?

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.780
Today is the Day of the Oracle.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.310
Once a week, the people come to hear

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:44.410
Yana's divine words 
through Princess Yana.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:47.310
They listen to Yana 
through Princess Yana?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.290
Sounds like a pain!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.730
I was hoping Yana could 
tell me the location

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.840
of my belated grandfather's will.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.900
I wonder if I'll ever get married.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:58.000
I want to get into a school 
in the Imperial Capital.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:01.050
I was hoping to ask Yana if 
I'll pass the entrance exam.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:05.130
Jeez! This is just a glorified 
consultation center!

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:09.990
Good morning, Captain Inukai.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.400
Good morning.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.670
This is Shino Inuzuka.
 I told you about him yesterday.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.190
He is this dog's owner.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:16.820
Hiya!

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.820
It's a pleasure. I am Takanobu.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:22.290
So how long's this been going on?

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:27.080
Your shrine's barrier isn't 
fulfilling its purpose anymore.

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:30.080
What did you welcome inside?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.610
Captain Inukai, who is this boy...?

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.780
Takanobu!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.090
It's horrible! Princess Yana is...!

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:47.850
It can't be!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:51.570
Brother Takanobu, don't worry.

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:54.130
I will carry out my duty until the end.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.860
Isn't this how all of the 
Princess Yanas before me died?

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.930
Princess Yana! You're still only 14!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:06.620
When I pass away, both yours and 
Saki's wishes will come true.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.170
You will be released from 
your positions as guardians;

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.370
you will be free.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.370
Princess Yana...

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:18.520
My final duty is to grant your wishes.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.630
Now then, what's your 
wish, Princess Yana?

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:27.440
My wish...?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.720
Do you grant other people's wishes

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.720
when you don't even know your own?

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:35.900
No wonder the Yana inside 
of you is exhausted!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:40.590
Shino, couldn't you phrase that 
a bit softer for the young lady?

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:43.400
I'm a kid, so I don't know 
how to do stuff like that!

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:45.470
Who are you?

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:46.910
Thanks for looking after my dog.

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:48.910
I see...

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.020
You must be happy.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.280
You have been reunited 
with your special owner.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:59.070
Everyone must be waiting.
 I will be leaving now.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.150
Princess Yana!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.120
Don't worry.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.760
After I die, the next 
Princess Yana will be born.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.180
I am merely its current vessel.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:09.930
Princess Yana...

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.190
Shino, is there anything we can do?

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.840
Weren't you listening?

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.010
I asked what her wish was,

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:23.190
but Princess Yana couldn't 
answer the question.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:27.320
She might not have been able 
to, even if she wanted to.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.690
She may be a 14-year old girl,

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:32.440
but she has lived as Yana.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:36.480
She probably can't bring herself to say,
 "I want to live as a normal person."

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.650
With her duty held above all else,

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.060
she has not been not 
allowed to speak her mind.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:45.000
She has basically been ordered to die.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.150
She could have refused.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.080
She's the vessel for the mighty Yana,

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.720
so she should be a bit more outspoken.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:55.100
Not everyone can be like you, Shino.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:13:59.920
Yana...

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.360
Yes?

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.200
We only want one thing,

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.530
so could you grant mine and Saki's wish?

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.370
This wish belongs to you and Saki?

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:11.120
That's right.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.270
But that will come true once I am gone!

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.370
Please hear us out, Princess Yana!

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:19.630
What do you want me to do?!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.790
Didn't you intentionally draw that here

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.520
precisely because you wanted to help?

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.380
So you noticed after all?

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:30.390
That's quite a doozy you've picked up.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.660
Is Murasame okay with this?

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.960
I warned Murasame not to eat him.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:39.930
But how am I supposed to 
do anything when the lady

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:41.400
in question is actin' like that?

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:45.450
Very well.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:50.420
In that case, please do not steal

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.280
our precious little sister from us.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.290
Your little sister?
 Who would that be?

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.040
Who is there other than you?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.400
My parents have already passed away.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.770
My siblings are enjoying happy lives

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:08.370
with their various foster parents.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.250
Likewise, Saki's parents are also gone.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.430
Neither of us have homes 
or families to return to.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.020
So when Yana gave us 
a new little sister,

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.780
we thanked Him from the 
bottom of our hearts.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:22.560
Yana, please live!

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:27.190
It is sinful for me to think 
of you as my little sister.

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:30.700
But-but I really do...!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:35.200
We don't want you to give us 
something after you are dead!

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.350
Instead, could you please grant

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.830
the wish we are presenting to you now?

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.110
What's your wish?

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.350
I... I...

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.570
Let us go.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:51.160
Yana!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:51.970
Princess Yana!

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.920
Princess Yana!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:10.270
This isn't the time to 
grant stupid little wishes!

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.680
Yesterday four villagers were killed!

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.700
Shouldn't that come first?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.060
My dad was one of the 
people killed yesterday!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:21.480
If the regional deity's 
curse is behind this,

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.880
please do something!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.730
Aren't you Princess Yana?!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.050
Give my dad back!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:37.420
Aren't you here to grant our wishes?!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.260
Very we-

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.770
Moron! Don't grant a wish like that!

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:57.160
A-a demon!

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:58.310
Yana!

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.030
Princess Yana!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:02.790
What is your wish, Princess Yana?

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:05.020
My wish...

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.110
Yana!

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.280
Give her back! Give Yana back to us!

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.170
Unhand her! Put Yana down!

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:16.160
Brother Takanobu... Saki...

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.180
What is your wish?

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:25.580
I want... I want to become just Yana.

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:31.090
I don't want to die...!

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:31.760
Yana!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:32.210
Yana! Yana!

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:41.900
Yana!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.900
Yana! Yana...!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.210
Brother, Saki... I don't want to die...!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.570
Yana!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.650
Yana...

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.030
Did you hear that, Shino?

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:59.510
Yeah, yeah, sure did.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:06.760
Princess Yana- No, Yana!

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.100
Don't you worry.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:11.300
Your wish will come true.

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.970
You see, the Yana inside of 
you shares the same wish.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.020
Neato...

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.770
You look way cooler when you're whole.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:51.880
Yana's Seal...

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:56.520
It was originally Yana's duty 
to grant its vessel's wish.

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.390
At long last, you have 
finally fulfilled your duty.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:00.830
You did great!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.530
Now you're free to go wherever you like.

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:05.320
We lack the strength to do so.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:10.040
We would be willing to sleep 
within a new vessel...

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:12.300
Huh? Don't look at me!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:13.430
I've already got Murasame!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.280
Then We have no choice but to fade away.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:18.400
You don't leave me much choice...

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.370
Ao! You're over there, aren't you?

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:21.480
Come on out!

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.430
You're the one...!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.310
You don't expect me to become

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.810
Yana's vessel when it's in 
that weakened state, do you?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.940
We wouldn't even be in this mess if 
you didn't kill the regional deity!

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.550
Shino, if you asked cutely enough,

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:40.820
I'd be willing to do it for you.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.070
Ao, please!

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.830
I really don't want to do this!

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:07.910
I expect you to return 
the favor someday.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.200
How so?

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:12.230
For instance, next time I 
will go and kill Sosuke.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:17.090
Who do you take me for?

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.560
When that time comes, 
I will cut you down

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.990
without a moment's hesitation.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.640
I thought you'd say that.

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.690
Wait, dammit! Give So's gem back!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.500
My gem?

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:36.270
Forget it! If you want it so badly,

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:38.570
why don't you hunt me down 
again and take it back?

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.040
What?!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.200
So that's what this was about?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.340
Oh, well...

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:01.090
Rumor has it that a demon 
kidnapped Princess Yana.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:05.230
And now everyone is blaming Yana's 
curse on that demon, right?

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.100
Yeah, that sums it up.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:11.270
Kobungo, did you give them that 
letter of introduction for Kona-ya?

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:14.190
Yep! I sent Ma a telegram 
while I was at it.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:15.330
Thank you!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.070
Well, I'm sure those 
three will get along

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:19.550
just fine as siblings 
in the Imperial Capital.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.850
Look, look, Brother!

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:23.520
That lake is pretty!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.400
Yana, don't lean out the 
window. It's dangerous!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.300
Okay!

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:30.490
Really, Yana! You can't 
seem to sit still.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:31.560
Can you blame me, Sister?

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:34.500
This is my first time 
seeing the outside world!

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.820
I wonder what the Imperial 
Capital is like.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.060
I'm so excited!

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:41.320
Yana...

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.560
From now on, you will have to

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:45.860
grant all of your wishes on your own.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:47.730
But...

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:50.520
if you wish hard enough...

00:21:51.930 --> 00:21:54.270
...they are sure to come true!

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:41.060
Reminiscence

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:29.530
Keno, do you believe in wind weasels?

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:30.970
That was random!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:32.990
Of course I don't 
believe in gay weasels.

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:35.200
No, I said, "wind weasels," 
not, "gay weasels"!

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:36.650
What type of weasels are those?

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:38.010
What color is their fur?

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:40.130
Deep blue?
